 "nl": [
  "Deny all traffic from monitoring to scada (this overrides any public service).",
  "vpn-users must accept SMTP (TCP 25) from engineering.",
  "Deny all traffic from engineering to guest-wifi (this overrides any public service).",
  "Hosts in scada may reach guest-wifi over SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Allow guest-wifi to connect to iot-sensors using IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Hosts in partners may reach vpn-users over IMAP (TCP 143) and SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "engineering must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and SSH (TCP 22) from partners.",
  "nvr may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards vpn-users, except RDP (TCP 3389), MySQL (TCP 3306), which must be blocked.",
  "Allow guest-wifi to connect to partners using LDAP (TCP 389) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "No packet from dns-servers may enter scada, even for services open to everyone.",
  "backup must never reach scada, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Allow scada to connect to backup using SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Make DNS over UDP 53 on vpn-users reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Hosts in monitoring may reach dns-servers over NTP (UDP 123) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) on iot-sensors reachable from all internal zones."
 ],
